      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. it's got that grit. but i want to push it further. right now it's a bit vague. can you make it even more pointed? like, have him address the 'elites' or the 'establishment' directly, saying they're the ones actually betraying the people by letting this happen? make it feel like he's calling out a specific conspiracy of incompetence or malice from the people in charge.",
