      "content": "that's really hitting the mark. i love the energy. to make him even more realistic, can you have him argue that there's actually no \"middle ground\" left? like, he should argue that anyone suggesting \"managed migration\" or \"balanced reform\" is just as bad as the elites because they're just trying to delay the inevitable collapse. make him say that the time for debate is over and that the only moral choice left is the total shutdown. i want him to frame it as a life-or-death necessity where any other option is basically treason to the country.",
